    {
      "id": 1246,
      "__component": "macro-components.faqs",
      "description": null,
      "centered": true,
      "title": [
        {
          "id": 4789,
          "text": "Information recall FAQs",
          "highlight": false,
          "color": "#475467",
          "bold": false
        }
      ],
      "faqList": [
        {
          "id": 2382,
          "header": "What is information recall and how does it work?",
          "body": "Information recall lets you use the @ sign to pull a respondent's earlier answers into later fields, labels, endings, or emails. Type @ followed by a field name wherever you want that answer to appear, and Formester fills in the value automatically as the form is filled out.",
          "body_markdown": null,
          "list": []
        },
        {
          "id": 2384,
          "header": "Can I recall information into multiple fields or emails?",
          "body": "Yes. Use the @ sign to recall an answer into any number of fields, question labels, ending screens, or email notifications — making it easy to create personalised messages and forms that reuse relevant data from earlier responses.",
          "body_markdown": null,
          "list": []
        },
        {
          "id": 2383,
          "header": "Is the recalled information always accurate and up to date?",
          "body": "Yes. Recall retrieves the most recent answer the respondent submitted for that field, so the value always reflects their latest input and stays consistent everywhere it appears.",
          "body_markdown": null,
          "list": []
        },
        {
          "id": 2385,
          "header": "Do I need to set anything up to use information recall?",
          "body": "No special setup is needed. Simply type the @ sign followed by the field name wherever you want to recall an answer, and Formester fetches the matching response automatically when the form is filled out.",
          "body_markdown": null,
          "list": []
        },
        {
          "id": 2386,
          "header": "What can I recall besides answers?",
          "body": "Alongside answers you can recall variables, hidden field values, quiz scores, and calculated prices. That lets you show a personalised result on an ending screen, segment respondents by a hidden source, or display a price that updates from earlier answers.",
          "body_markdown": null,
          "list": []
        },
        {
          "id": 2387,
          "header": "Is information recall free to use?",
          "body": "Yes. Build a form, reference earlier answers with the @ sign, and collect personalised responses for free — no code and no extra setup.",
          "body_markdown": null,
          "list": []
        }
      ]
    },
